%%begintext align
%% Lead up all a D. and back, sett and turn S .| Lead down all a D. and back, sett and turn S :|
%% The 1st Man take his Wo. with his right Hand, then with his Left, and so holding
%% Hands across change Places, fall back from each other, meet again, fall back, then
%% Arms with your Wo. and stay in your Places, the Man on the Wo. Side, and the Wo.
%% on the Mans .:| Hands in like manner with the 2d Wo. changing Places with her on
%% the right Hand, while the Wo. do the like with the 2d Man, Holding him in her left
%% Hand, both Cu. fall back from each other, meet again, fall back, Arms with your own,
%% and so forward to the rest, who following does the like.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Take your own Wo. in your right Hand, and the 2d Wo. in your left, meet the 2d Man, fall
%% back, each Man honour to his own Wo. then to each other's Wo. take them by their
%% right Hands, then your own by the Left, the 1st Cu. into the 2d Place, and the 2d Cu. into
%% the 1st Place .| The rest following :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Lead up all a D. and back, cast off all and meet, the 1st Cu. below, and the last Cu. above.
%% take your We. in your left Hand, and lead them all to the left round about the same Places
%% Lead down all a D. and back, cast off, and meet in your own Places as at the first, take your
%% We. in your right Hands, and lead them round about on the right Hand to your Places .|
%% [CCDM1]
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
